        { q: "What's not included?", a: "Flights, airport transfers to/from the hotel, and any personal expenses outside the group program." },
        { q: "How and when do I pay?", a: "Register by August 7, 2026. After the deadline, you’ll receive a personalized payment link based on your room choice: single room (€1,923.83) or double room with guest (€2,895.28 for both)." },
        { q: "Can I bring a guest?", a: "Yes. Select “Attending with Guest” when you register. The guest package covers their hotel room (double occupancy) and full participation in all group activities for the same total price of €2,895.28." },
        { q: "Does my guest pay the same rate?", a: "The €2,895.28 price covers both of you. It is not a per-person rate. You pay one amount for the pair, which includes the double room and two program spots." },
        { q: "What’s the Turkish Airlines discount?", a: "An exclusive 30% discount on base fare is available to AMP 210 registrants across all cabin classes. Taxes and surcharges are not discounted. Your promo code will be emailed to you upon registration." },
        { q: "Which airport should I fly into?", a: "Istanbul Airport (IST) is the main international gateway and closest to the Swissôtel. Sabiha Gökçen (SAW) on the Asian side is significantly further. IST is strongly preferred." },
        { q: "Can I arrive early or stay later than the program dates?", a: "Absolutely. The Swissôtel is holding rooms at the group rate for a limited window before and after the program. Contact the hotel directly and mention the AMP 210 block to extend your stay." },
        { q: "What if I arrive late on Thursday?", a: "No problem. Thursday evening is unstructured. There are no group activities that day, so you won’t miss anything. Attendees typically arrange informal dinners among themselves. The program begins Friday morning." },
        { q: "What’s the dress code for the Celebration Dinner?", a: "Smart casual to business casual. The dinner is at Frankie Galataport, one of Istanbul’s most celebrated restaurants, so dress accordingly." },
        { q: "What if I have dietary restrictions?", a: "We are arranging vegetarian options across all group meals. For other dietary requirements, please note them in the comment field when you register and we’ll do our best to accommodate." },
        { q: "Is there a cancellation or refund policy?", a: "Payment details and cancellation terms will be communicated with your payment link after August 7. If you have concerns about attending, reach out before registering." },
        { q: "How are the professors' costs covered?", a: "All professor costs are covered in full and will be split equally among AMP 210 attendees. Final amount to be confirmed." },
        { q: "Who do I contact if I have questions?", a: "Please contact the customer service team via WhatsApp at +90 212 284 63 63." }
      ];

      var container = document.getElementById('faq-list');
      faqs.forEach(function(item, i) {
        var wrap = document.createElement('div');

        var btn = document.createElement('button');
        btn.style.cssText = 'width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 0;text-align:left;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;gap:16px;';

        var qText = document.createElement('span');
        qText.style.cssText = 'font-family:EB Garamond,Georgia,serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:400;color:#1C1C1C;line-height:1.3;';
        qText.textContent = item.q;

        var icon = document.createElement('span');
        icon.style.cssText = 'flex-shrink:0;width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#A51C30;transition:transform 0.2s;';
        icon.innerHTML = '<svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="14"/><line x1="2" y1="8" x2="14" y2="8"/></svg>';

        btn.appendChild(qText);
        btn.appendChild(icon);

        var answer = document.createElement('div');
        answer.style.cssText = 'overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height 0.3s ease;';

        var aText = document.createElement('p');
        aText.style.cssText = 'padding:0 0 20px;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.7;color:#4a4a4a;';
        aText.textContent = item.a;

        answer.appendChild(aText);
        wrap.appendChild(btn);
        wrap.appendChild(answer);
        container.appendChild(wrap);

        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
          var isOpen = answer.style.maxHeight !== '0px' && answer.style.maxHeight !== '';
          if (isOpen) {
            answer.style.maxHeight = '0px';
            icon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
            icon.innerHTML = '<svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="14"/><line x1="2" y1="8" x2="14" y2="8"/></svg>';
          } else {
            answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + 'px';
            icon.style.transform = 'rotate(45deg)';
          }
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>

  <!-- WHO'S COMING -->
